{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_030_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:57c49cfb120b730c2f14b3292be00d77c5abf136588fea85ec43d9520ab70f91",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c13fc231201671a399b2260b5e43e994a7110309da8ecc7db4768c05fce7202",
      "text": "卷绪先生，我准备了饮品。\n请用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6c0c3d3435715382c6b2d7cb0ef52a2d42968894af2afead4e101366e65cfba",
      "text": "哇，非常感谢！\n……那我开动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9c1cc9d4bd07cfd43453e02142fa26cddb392c10ffa03ef732b5e957dd50ddd",
      "text": "现场没能好好问您，\n今天的拍摄感觉怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c7a42b470fa1f3eb69bdbfa25ce9cae16a3be8b6b266d731dca87cc5ca81e87",
      "text": "非常开心！\n感觉时间一下子就过去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6071f4b50aed40757415627de6936401a1730f92cd2f15c58662895079624c77",
      "text": "工作人员们都非常随和，\n我们聊了好多话题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fac9219a0e7036a7b9df859bd0e810f53c08696e31953619401fe6b6932c143",
      "text": "我们聊最喜欢哪种蛋糕聊得很尽兴呢。\n大家分成了海绵蛋糕派和水果挞派，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2cf9ecc6ef2ae920ee2852082d2b445ec0f71f1efa73604128a90e1827d214b",
      "text": "还互相推荐了各自看好的店铺。多亏聊了那些，\n我完全没有紧张就投入到拍摄中了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2f419730b4b6026351133305d7a842ac53d24c0861f82b6f7952758b29fa71a",
      "text": "聊起蛋糕话题时的卷绪先生，\n看起来特别开心、充满活力呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6279e5df079885c91f14a62882b7bc406fa8b808e94f67b34b0c2c5875185d51",
      "text": "摄影师也说，看到那个表情之后，\n拍摄的构思就变得更加清晰了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:426616e8c04bf0c48fc8dbdd39a0d8c94e40111a7f351c82d6acf766e8c2a316",
      "text": "原来您和摄影师聊了这些啊。\n能帮上忙，我好开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
